# Project Startup

Before planning, editing, or running project commands, read these files in order:

1. `AGENTS.md`
2. `docs/START_HERE.md`
3. `docs/PROJECT_STATUS.md`
4. `docs/arch/code-map.md`
5. `初步入库评测指标.md`

For metric work, then read only the relevant section of `共性指标.md`. Read
`mcp_tool_manual.json` only when tool names, parameters, or schemas are involved.

Always inspect `git status` before editing and preserve unrelated user changes.
Never implement a concrete metric until its formula, field mapping, boundary behavior,
and worked example have been shown to the user and explicitly approved.

After a verified batch, update `docs/PROJECT_STATUS.md` when the current milestone,
next action, known blockers, or verification baseline changed.
